1
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:46,060
Heavenly Emperor Zhaohan,

2
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,530
receiving the mandate of heaven,

3
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:48,760
ascends the throne.

4
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:50,460
May his reign last forever.

5
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:55,230
I can finally marry Zhaohan.

6
00:00:56,030 --> 00:00:59,230
Congratulations on your wedding today, God of War Baili.

7
00:01:00,030 --> 00:01:02,530
God of War Baili has guarded the Heavenly Palace for 300 years.

8
00:01:02,530 --> 00:01:05,260
The position of Heavenly Empress belongs to her.

9
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:36,300
My mother left this to me.

10
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:37,630
I'm giving it to you today.

11
00:01:37,630 --> 00:01:38,060
Li'er.

12
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,800
When I ascend the throne,

13
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:41,460
you will be the Heavenly Empress.

14
00:01:41,460 --> 00:01:43,130
I will protect you for all lifetimes.

15
00:01:43,130 --> 00:01:44,200
It's just a broken jade pendant

16
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:46,800
that can be found anywhere in the mortal realm.

17
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:49,289
You actually kept it until now.

18
00:01:49,630 --> 00:01:51,259
You are so naive.

19
00:01:58,900 --> 00:02:01,230
It turns out you were lying to me all along.

20
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:04,060
Your Majesty.

21
00:02:05,130 --> 00:02:05,930
Your Majesty.

22
00:02:06,060 --> 00:02:07,960
God of War Baili secretly colluded with the Demon Tribe,

23
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:09,530
intending to subvert the Heavenly Realm.

24
00:02:09,530 --> 00:02:10,699
The irrefutable evidence is here.

25
00:02:10,699 --> 00:02:12,760
Qingyu risks his life to report this.

26
00:02:14,030 --> 00:02:16,100
You colluded with each other, didn't you?

27
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:17,030
Baili,

28
00:02:18,130 --> 00:02:19,660
do you have anything to say?

29
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,130
Zhaohan.

30
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,530
For 300 years,

31
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:25,700
I blocked seven heavenly tribulations for you.

32
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:26,060
Is this how you

33
00:02:26,060 --> 00:02:26,900
repay me?

34
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:30,530
Do you want me to live in your shadow for the rest of my life?

35
00:02:30,530 --> 00:02:32,460
The Six Realms only know God of War Baili.

36
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:34,730
Who remembers Heavenly Emperor Zhaohan?

37
00:02:34,730 --> 00:02:36,030
You are jealous of me.

38
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:39,800
Didn't I do all this for you?

39
00:02:41,730 --> 00:02:43,329
The evidence is conclusive.

40
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,560
Deal with her according to the heavenly rules.

41
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,430
Zhaohan.

42
00:02:47,130 --> 00:02:49,630
You said that when you ascend the throne,

43
00:02:49,630 --> 00:02:51,800
you would protect me for all lifetimes.

44
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:54,530
Were those words all lies?

45
00:02:55,860 --> 00:02:56,630
Guards,

46
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:59,260
strip her of her divine bones.

47
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:18,760
Maybe I shouldn't have met you 300 years ago.

48
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,900
By the order of the Heavenly Emperor,

49
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:26,360
the Spirit Flower Sea will be leveled today.

50
00:03:27,900 --> 00:03:30,930
You planted those flowers for me with your own hands.

51
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:34,230
His Majesty ordered that the Spirit Flower Sea is as guilty as the traitorous god.

52
00:03:34,230 --> 00:03:35,960
Not a single plant will be left.

53
00:03:42,230 --> 00:03:43,460
God of War Baili.

54
00:03:43,730 --> 00:03:45,260
Her divine bones have been stripped,

55
00:03:45,260 --> 00:03:46,730
and she has lost all her magic power.

56
00:03:46,730 --> 00:03:48,460
Throw her into the Demon Realm.

57
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:11,060
Where

58
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:11,860
is this?

59
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,730
Who am I?

60
00:04:20,930 --> 00:04:21,730
Oh,

61
00:04:21,930 --> 00:04:23,760
isn't this God of War Baili?

62
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:26,230
She seems to have lost all her magic power.

63
00:04:26,230 --> 00:04:26,960
It really is her.

64
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:29,460
Three hundred years ago, she split my lair with one sword strike

65
00:04:29,460 --> 00:04:31,030
and killed 17 of my brothers.

66
00:04:31,030 --> 00:04:32,030
Do you

67
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,300
know me?

68
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,130
Hahaha.

69
00:04:37,730 --> 00:04:40,130
Pretending not to know us now won't work,

70
00:04:40,530 --> 00:04:41,700
God of War Baili.

71
00:04:45,530 --> 00:04:47,430
You still know pain.

72
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:55,030
Her divine bones have been extracted.

73
00:04:55,030 --> 00:04:56,800
No wonder she doesn't remember anything.

74
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,800
How majestic you were 300 years ago.

75
00:04:58,900 --> 00:05:00,030
The number one God of War in the Six Realms.

76
00:05:00,030 --> 00:05:01,100
Who wouldn't kneel when they saw you?

77
00:05:01,100 --> 00:05:03,260
And now? You don't even remember who you are.

78
00:05:03,260 --> 00:05:03,900
Let me go.

79
00:05:03,900 --> 00:05:05,260
You don't remember?

80
00:05:05,530 --> 00:05:07,190
Then let's help her remember.

81
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:24,220
It's cold on the ground. Hurry and get up.

82
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:28,130
It's cold on the ground.

83
00:05:28,130 --> 00:05:28,860
Wifey,

84
00:05:28,860 --> 00:05:29,960
get up.

85
00:05:35,460 --> 00:05:36,460
Thank you.

86
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:37,600
Wait.

87
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,930
What did you call me?

88
00:05:39,100 --> 00:05:39,900
Your husband.

89
00:05:40,260 --> 00:05:40,860
What?

90
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:43,060
Did the fall make you forget your own husband?
